// /app/components/app-degenerette-panel.js — Phase 62 Plan 62-03 (BUY-05)
//
// Degenerette bet panel: place → poll RNG → settled (automatically by the
// keeper sweep, or early by an optional "settle now"). Custom Element shell
// mirrors Phase 60 / 61 / 62-01 / 62-02 patterns: light DOM, idempotent
// customElements.define, symmetric connectedCallback / disconnectedCallback,
// #unsubs[], panel-owned 30s poll cycle PLUS a per-bet RNG poll subcycle.
//
// On-chain surfaces (audit 224de529, docs/DEGENERETTE-BET-QUEUE.md):
//   - DegenerusGame.betDegenerette(player, currency, amountPerSpin,
//                                       spinCount, symbol)
//                                       payable
//                                       → emits DegeneretteBetPlaced(player, index, betId, packed)
//     A bet is identified by (index, betId): betId is its queue position + 1
//     WITHIN the lootbox RNG index, not a per-player nonce.
//   AUDIT a5d4d2cd replaced the old `uint32 customTicket, uint8 heroQuadrant`
//   pair with a single `uint8 symbol` (now 0..23): quadrant = symbol >> 3, icon =
//   symbol & 7. The player picks ONE symbol; the contract generates a fresh
//   ticket every spin with only that symbol forced into its quadrant — every
//   other quadrant is rolled by the house. The hero color is wild. See DegenerusGameDegeneretteModule.sol `_playerTicket` /
//   `_spinSymbol` / `_score` in degenerus-sim.
//   - poll the Degenerette feed for lootbox_rng readiness + word. The word is
//                    KEPT: every spin's house reel is derived from it
//                    (dgn-reels.js).
//   - Once the word lands the bet SETTLES AUTOMATICALLY on the next mineRun()
//     crank (the sweep walks each finalized index's boxes, then its bet queue).
//     The READY card watches degeneretteBetInfo(index, betId) go to zero and
//     then replays the settlement. Clicking it is an optional early settle:
//     DegenerusGame.mineRun() — permissionless, in order, the only door since audit
//     18490c6fe (audit 2525eb7fd removed the per-bet resolveDegeneretteBets door), so it
//     settles whatever is queued ahead of the bet first → DegeneretteResolved
//     (every spin in one event) once the sweep reaches it
//
// State machine:
//   idle → placing → awaitingRng → ready ──(sweep settles)──→ indexing → resolved
//                                     └──(settle now)→ resolving ─┘       ↓
//                                                                          idle
//
// The widget owns ticket construction, wagering, pending-RNG state, and the
// optional settle transaction. Every completed result is handed to the
// shared branded reveal overlay; there is deliberately no second reel player
// embedded in this panel.
//
// Carry-forwards (CONTEXT 62-CONTEXT.md):
//   CF-01: Phase 58 closure-form sendTx — flows through degenerette.js (place + settle).
//   CF-02: Phase 56 reason-map decodeRevertReason on every catch.
//   CF-03: Phase 56 requireStaticCall pre-flight inside degenerette.js.
//   CF-05: receipt-log-first parsers (DegeneretteBetPlaced + DegeneretteResolved).
//   CF-06: NEVER optimistic balance subtraction. 250ms post-confirm refetch.
//   CF-07: T-58-18 — error.userMessage rendered via .textContent.
//   CF-15: data-write attribute on Place; RNG/resolve writes are exposed only
//          through the shared pending-action tray.
//
// Class palette: .deg-* prefix.

